    <briefdescription>
<para>Square-root stochastic-volatility Bates process. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class describes the square root stochastic volatility process incl jumps governed by <formula id="327">\[ \begin{array}{rcl} dS(t, S) &amp;=&amp; (r-d-\lambda m) S dt +\sqrt{v} S dW_1 + (e^J - 1) S dN \\ dv(t, S) &amp;=&amp; \kappa (\theta - v) dt + \sigma \sqrt{v} dW_2 \\ dW_1 dW_2 &amp;=&amp; \rho dt \\ \omega(J) &amp;=&amp; \frac{1}{\sqrt{2\pi \delta^2}} \exp\left[-\frac{(J-\nu)^2}{2\delta^2}\right] \end{array} \]</formula> </para>    </detaileddescription>
